                    <div class="bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-green-200">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-green-900 mb-1">Future Simple</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-green-700">Akan terjadi</p>
                        <p class="text-xs mt-2 bg-white p-2 rounded">I will eat tomorrow</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-purple-200">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-purple-900 mb-1">Present Continuous</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-purple-700">Sedang berlangsung</p>
                        <p class="text-xs mt-2 bg-white p-2 rounded">I am eating now</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-pink-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-pink-200">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-pink-900 mb-1">Past Continuous</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-pink-700">Sedang terjadi di masa lalu</p>
                        <p class="text-xs mt-2 bg-white p-2 rounded">I was eating</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-teal-50 p-4 rounded-xl border border-teal-200">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-teal-900 mb-1">Present Perfect</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-teal-700">Sudah selesai, hasil terasa</p>
                        <p class="text-xs mt-2 bg-white p-2 rounded">I have eaten</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="quiz">
                    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-pen-to-square text-sky-600"></i>
                        Latihan: Cocokkan Fungsi Tenses
                    </h3>
                    <div class="space-y-6" id="quiz-2"></div>
                    <div id="quiz-feedback-2" class="mt-6 hidden"></div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Topic 4: Verb, Adverb, Adjective -->
        <div id="topic-3" class="tab-content">
            <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 p-6 sm:p-8 mb-6">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
                    <div class="w-14 h-14 gradient-bg rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-white shrink-0">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-shapes text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex-1">
                        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold mb-2">4. Bedakan Verb, Adverb, Adjective</h2>
                        <p class="text-slate-600">3 jenis kata penting dalam Bahasa Inggris</p>
                        <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2">
                            <span class="text-sm font-medium">Skor:</span>
                            <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold" id="score-3">0/8</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="space-y-4 mb-8">
                    <div class="bg-red-50 border-2 border-red-200 p-5 rounded-xl">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-red-900 mb-2">1. VERB (Kata Kerja)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm mb-2"><strong>Ciri:</strong> Menunjukkan aksi, tindakan, atau keadaan</p>
                        <p class="text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded"><strong>Contoh:</strong> run, eat, study, is, are, have, sleep</p>
                        <p class="text-xs mt-2 text-red-700">→ She <span class="font-bold">runs</span> fast</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-blue-50 border-2 border-blue-200 p-5 rounded-xl">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-blue-900 mb-2">2. ADJECTIVE (Kata Sifat)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm mb-2"><strong>Ciri:</strong> Menjelaskan sifat/kondisi kata benda (noun)</p>
                        <p class="text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded"><strong>Contoh:</strong> beautiful, tall, smart, happy, big</p>
                        <p class="text-xs mt-2 text-blue-700">→ She is a <span class="font-bold">beautiful</span> girl</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-green-50 border-2 border-green-200 p-5 rounded-xl">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-green-900 mb-2">3. ADVERB (Kata Keterangan)</h3>
                        <p class="text-sm mb-2"><strong>Ciri:</strong> Menjelaskan kata kerja, sifat, atau adverb lain. Banyak berakhiran -ly</p>
                        <p class="text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded"><strong>Contoh:</strong> quickly, very, always, well, carefully</p>
                        <p class="text-xs mt-2 text-green-700">→ She runs <span class="font-bold">quickly</span></p>
